==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|anatomy}} A round nodule, small eminence, or warty outgrowth, especially those found on [[bone]]s for the attachment of a [[muscle]] or [[ligament]] or small elevations on the surface of a tooth.
# {{label|en|botany}} A small rounded wartlike protuberance of the roots of some [[leguminous]] plants; the lip of certain [[orchid]]s, [[cactus|cacti]].
# {{label|en|pathology}} A small rounded nodule forming the characteristic [[lesion]] of [[tuberculosis]].

====Synonyms====
* [[tuberculum]]
* [[tuberosity]]
* [[eminence]]
* [[nodule]]

